//
// Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B verify: a layer (attention and MoE) and the LM head each
// against the CPU reference; the fused prefill's last logits against it; the
// prompt prefilled into the 48-layer decode, its greedy tokens against the
// reference; the prompt a token at a time across a read length boundary;
// the reference's layers against HF transformers' fed the same
// weights; the top-k token-set gate against HF bf16.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, hfweights_qwen_qwen3_coder_30b_a3b_instruct
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_peano_verify
// RUN: cd test_peano_verify
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile verify PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: PASS!
// CHECK: PASS!
// CHECK: tokens: logits cos
// CHECK: PASS!
// CHECK: prefill of {{[0-9]+}} tokens
// CHECK: ' is Paris
// CHECK: PASS!
// CHECK: L=16: next
// CHECK: L=17: next
// CHECK: PASS!
// CHECK: PASS!
// CHECK: [verify] PASS
